{
  "title": "System DMA: 4 channels of copy and fill jobs served round robin over AXI4",
  "code": "0x5C09",
  "version": "1.0",
  "axi_master": {
    "id": 7,
    "reads": true,
    "writes": true,
    "port_prefix": "m_",
    "addr_bits": 32,
    "data_bits": 32,
    "id_bits": 4,
    "max_burst": 16
  },
  "features": [
    "Per channel n: SRCn, DSTn, LENn (32-bit words), MODE.moden (0 COPY, 1 FILL with FILLn), CMD.startn queues the channel.",
    "Queued channels are served one job at a time in round-robin order (the first queued channel after the last one served).",
    "COPY: DST word i = SRC word i. FILL: DST word i = FILLn (no reads).",
    "CHECKSUM: 32-bit sum of the words written by the last job; STATUS.active_ch the channel being (last) served."
  ],
  "tb_clk_ns": 10,
  "regs": [
    {
      "name": "SRC0",
      "kind": "rw",
      "desc": "Channel 0 source address",
      "fields": [
        {
          "port": "src0",
          "reset": "0",
          "desc": "byte address, word aligned"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "DST0",
      "kind": "rw",
      "desc": "Channel 0 destination address",
      "fields": [
        {
          "port": "dst0",
          "reset": "0",
          "desc": "byte address, word aligned"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LEN0",
      "kind": "rw",
      "desc": "Channel 0 length",
      "fields": [
        {
          "port": "len0",
          "reset": "0",
          "desc": "32-bit words"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "FILL0",
      "kind": "rw",
      "desc": "Channel 0 fill word",
      "fields": [
        {
          "port": "fill0",
          "reset": "0",
          "desc": "FILL mode data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SRC1",
      "kind": "rw",
      "desc": "Channel 1 source address",
      "fields": [
        {
          "port": "src1",
          "reset": "0",
          "desc": "byte address, word aligned"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
